t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 31st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Wide Straight Conveyor</b> is a structure that can be bought from <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It is a widened straight section of conveyor belt with small walls.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>The Wide Straight Conveyor is functionally identical to the standard <a href=\"/wiki/Straight_Conveyor\" title=\"Straight Conveyor\">Straight Conveyor</a>. The only difference is that the Wide Straight Conveyor is 8 studs wide instead of 6 studs wide. When placed, the Wide Straight Conveyor is a 8&#215;2&#215;8 object. It can be resized to be as short as 6 studs in length, or as long as 12 studs in length.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163802\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 82/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 497/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019474/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.757      1 -total\n 91.96%   36.559      1 Template:Objects\n  7.85%    3.119      1 Template:Removed\n  3.49%    1.389      1 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:962-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163802 and revision id 11465. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Removed